T</strong>), select '<strong>SST</strong>'<br>\n- If you want to display only the anomaly, select '<strong>SSTa</strong>'<br>\n- If you want to display both the Sea Surface Temperature and the anomaly, select '<strong>SST_SSTa</strong>'.<br>\n\n", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 50, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "You have three possible options for selection:<br>\n- If you want to display only the Sea Surface Temperature (<strong>SST</strong>), select '<strong>SST</strong>'<br>\n- If you want to display only the anomaly, select '<strong>SSTa</strong>'<br>\n- If you want to display both the Sea Surface Temperature and the anomaly, select '<strong>SST_SSTa</strong>'.<br>\n\n", "name": "graph_selection Fig8"}], "label": "graph_selection Fig8", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 7315.832815845881, "top": 214.54530770785266}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"multiple\": false, \"validators\": [], \"restrictions\": [\"AT_ATa\", \"AT\", \"ATa\"], \"parameter_type\": \"text\", \"optional\": false}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "a97b9220-2cf1-4bbd-892b-3c16a8f560f7", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "95b0a86b-6d58-4e17-b239-c0d2d0dde838"}]}, "51": {"annotation": "Enter two years between 1978 and 2024, separated by a comma (e.g., 2000,2020). These years will define the start and end years for the figure display. The graph will start in the first year and end in the second year.", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 51, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "Enter two years between 1978 and 2024, separated by a comma (e.g., 2000,2020). These years will define the start and end years for the figure display. The graph will start in the first year and end in the second year.", "name": "Year_Fig8"}], "label": "Year_Fig8", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 7315.767446941078, "top": 310.79186119915664}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"default\": \"2001,2020\", \"multiple\": false, \"validators\": [], \"parameter_type\": \"text\", \"optional\": false}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "20f0358f-ec8d-4a2a-ba98-6a8c83d93cb6", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "5db2bfdf-020d-403b-8b2b-e53337ef95ac"}]}, "52": {"annotation": "This input allows you to choose which zones will be used or displayed for the data. There are two methods for defining the zones: <br>\n\n<u>1. Using Antarctic Subareas: </u> <br>\n<ul>\n  <li>  881, 882, 883, 481, 482, 483, 484, 485, 486, 5841, 5842, 5843a, 5843b, 5844a, 5844b, 5851, 5852, 586, 587</li>\n</ul>\n\n<u> 2. Using a Geographical Location (North, South, West, East coordinates): </u> <br>\n<ul>\n  <li>  N-45, S-90, W-180, E180 </li>\n</ul>\n\nThe order of the letters and the number of zones are not important, but the values must be <strong>separated by commas.</strong><br>\n\n<strong> !!! Note: Data limits apply\u2014avoid overly large zones to prevent problems </strong>", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 52, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "This input allows you to choose which zones will be used or displayed for the data. There are two methods for defining the zones: <br>\n\n<u>1. Using Antarctic Subareas: </u> <br>\n<ul>\n  <li>  881, 882, 883, 481, 482, 483, 484, 485, 486, 5841, 5842, 5843a, 5843b, 5844a, 5844b, 5851, 5852, 586, 587</li>\n</ul>\n\n<u> 2. Using a Geographical Location (North, South, West, East coordinates): </u> <br>\n<ul>\n  <li>  N-45, S-90, W-180, E180 </li>\n</ul>\n\nThe order of the letters and the number of zones are not important, but the values must be <strong>separated by commas.</strong><br>\n\n<strong> !!! Note: Data limits apply\u2014avoid overly large zones to prevent problems </strong>", "name": "Area Selection Fig8"}], "label": "Area Selection Fig8", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 7315.900104176102, "top": 420.8279433289425}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"default\": \"881\", \"multiple\": false, \"validators\": [], \"parameter_type\": \"text\", \"optional\": false}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "578a74aa-426a-49e3-8caf-1f86a14a51bb", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "8ee13d1e-42cd-4294-827e-48e271e2d7a6"}]}, "53": {"annotation": "", "content_id": "toolshed.g2.bx.psu.edu/repos/bgruening/text_processing/tp_text_file_with_recurring_lines/9.5+galaxy1", "errors": null, "id": 53, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [], "label": null, "name": "Create text file", "outputs": [{"name": "outfile", "type": "txt"}], "position": {"left": 8442.359566127101, "top": 201.03399117000055}, "post_job_actions": {}, "tool_id": "toolshed.g2.bx.psu.edu/repos/bgruening/text_processing/tp_text_file_with_recurring_lines/9.5+galaxy1", "tool_shed_repository": {"changeset_revision": "6073bb457ec0", "name": "text_processing", "owner": "bgruening", "tool_shed": "toolshed.g2.bx.psu.edu"}, "tool_state": "{\"token_set\": [{\"__index__\": 0, \"line\": \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TuturBaba/Antarctic/refs/heads/main/script/Fig9.ipynb\", \"repeat_select\": {\"repeat_select_opts\": \"user\", \"__current_case__\": 0, \"times\": \"1\"}}], \"__page__\": 0, \"__rerun_remap_job_id__\": null}", "tool_version": "9.5+galaxy1", "type": "tool", "uuid": "aca5f36d-a651-4a0b-b787-ad68e4bc103d", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": []}, "54": {"annotation": "Set this option to <b>Yes</b> to include the Fig 9 visualization in the output.<br>\nIf set to <b>No</b>, this figure will be skipped.<br><br>\n\nThis figure shows <b>monthly mean chlorophyll-a concentrations</b> based on satellite ocean colour data (<i>Copernicus-GlobColour</i>).<br>\nIt helps understand the <b>spatial and temporal variability</b> in surface primary production.<br>\n<b>White areas</b> indicate <b>persistent sea ice cover</b> during the month.<br>\n\n\n<center>\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TuturBaba/Antarctic/refs/heads/main/figure/Fig9.png\" width=\"400\">\n</center>\n", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 54, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "Set this option to <b>Yes</b> to include the Fig 9 visualization in the output.<br>\nIf set to <b>No</b>, this figure will be skipped.<br><br>\n\nThis figure shows <b>monthly mean chlorophyll-a concentrations</b> based on satellite ocean colour data (<i>Copernicus-GlobColour</i>).<br>\nIt helps understand the <b>spatial and temporal variability</b> in surface primary production.<br>\n<b>White areas</b> indicate <b>persistent sea ice cover</b> during the month.<br>\n\n\n<center>\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TuturBaba/Antarctic/refs/heads/main/figure/Fig9.png\" width=\"400\">\n</center>\n", "name": "FIG9: SEASONAL PHYTOPLANKTON BLOOM DYNAMICS"}], "label": "FIG9: SEASONAL PHYTOPLANKTON BLOOM DYNAMICS", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 8907.964879774605, "top": 59.674841818231315}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"default\": true, \"validators\": [], \"parameter_type\": \"boolean\", \"optional\": false}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "bc1a4e2f-db25-4cfc-bbe7-f352265dc2a2", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "a8a69f50-6242-45fb-9aad-73c7ecf649f3"}]}, "55": {"annotation": "To download the data, follow these steps: <br><br>\n\n<u>1. Go to the download page:</u> <strong> <a href=\"https://data.marine.copernicus.eu/product/OCEANCOLOUR_GLO_BGC_L4_MY_009_104/download?dataset=cmems_obs-oc_glo_bgc-plankton_my_l4-multi-4km_P1M_202411\">Copernicus Marine Data</a></strong><br><br>\n\n<u>2. Select only this product:</u> Mass concentration of chlorophyll a in sea water<br><br>\n\n<u>3. Choose the time period and spatial extent:</u><br>\nFurther down the page, specify the time period (date) and the geographic area for the data download.<br>\nYou may choose one or several months \u2014 it depends on your objective. (You will be able to choose whether to display a combined plot for all months or one plot per month.)<br>\nThen select the geographic extent. If you're unsure what to enter, here are the default coordinates: <strong>N-45, S-90, W-180, E180</strong><br><br>\n\n<u>4. Download the data</u><br><br>\n\n<u>5. Upload the file to your Galaxy history</u><br>", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 55, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "To download the data, follow these steps: <br><br>\n\n<u>1. Go to the download page:</u> <strong> <a href=\"https://data.marine.copernicus.eu/product/OCEANCOLOUR_GLO_BGC_L4_MY_009_104/download?dataset=cmems_obs-oc_glo_bgc-plankton_my_l4-multi-4km_P1M_202411\">Copernicus Marine Data</a></strong><br><br>\n\n<u>2. Select only this product:</u> Mass concentration of chlorophyll a in sea water<br><br>\n\n<u>3. Choose the time period and spatial extent:</u><br>\nFurther down the page, specify the time period (date) and the geographic area for the data download.<br>\nYou may choose one or several months \u2014 it depends on your objective. (You will be able to choose whether to display a combined plot for all months or one plot per month.)<br>\nThen select the geographic extent. If you're unsure what to enter, here are the default coordinates: <strong>N-45, S-90, W-180, E180</strong><br><br>\n\n<u>4. Download the data</u><br><br>\n\n<u>5. Upload the file to your Galaxy history</u><br>", "name": "Chlorophyll a Data \u2013 Copernicus Marine Download"}], "label": "Chlorophyll a Data \u2013 Copernicus Marine Download", "name": "Input dataset", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 8913.215047771753, "top": 343.97073316230336}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"optional\": true, \"tag\": null}", "tool_version": null, "type": "data_input", "uuid": "384ae597-ffa7-4aa3-a6ed-298affdf5142", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": []}, "56": {"annotation": "This input allows you to choose which zones will be used or displayed for the data. There are two methods for defining the zones: <br>\n\n<u>1. Using Antarctic Subareas: </u> <br>\n<ul>\n  <li>  881, 882, 883, 481, 482, 483, 484, 485, 486, 5841, 5842, 5843a, 5843b, 5844a, 5844b, 5851, 5852, 586, 587</li>\n</ul>\n\n<u> 2. Using a Geographical Location (North, South, West, East coordinates): </u> <br>\n<ul>\n  <li>  N-45, S-90, W-180, E180 </li>\n</ul>\n\nThe order of the letters and the number of zones are not important, but the values must be <strong>separated by commas.</strong>\n", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 56, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "This input allows you to choose which zones will be used or displayed for the data. There are two methods for defining the zones: <br>\n\n<u>1. Using Antarctic Subareas: </u> <br>\n<ul>\n  <li>  881, 882, 883, 481, 482, 483, 484, 485, 486, 5841, 5842, 5843a, 5843b, 5844a, 5844b, 5851, 5852, 586, 587</li>\n</ul>\n\n<u> 2. Using a Geographical Location (North, South, West, East coordinates): </u> <br>\n<ul>\n  <li>  N-45, S-90, W-180, E180 </li>\n</ul>\n\nThe order of the letters and the number of zones are not important, but the values must be <strong>separated by commas.</strong>\n", "name": "Area Selection Fig9"}], "label": "Area Selection Fig9", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 8913.215047771753, "top": 473.97073316230336}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"default\": \"881, 882, 883, 481, 482, 483, 484, 485, 486, 5841, 5842, 5843a, 5843b, 5844a, 5844b, 5851, 5852, 586, 587\", \"multiple\": false, \"validators\": [{\"message\": \"\", \"expression\": \"\", \"negate\": false, \"type\": \"regex\"}], \"parameter_type\": \"text\", \"optional\": false}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "9753f6f2-5724-439f-8077-dbd290462425", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "a79265d6-521a-4f62-9a61-098f40b6707e"}]}, "57": {"annotation": "There are three options for how the data will be visualized:<br><br>\n\n<u>single_month</u>: Use this if you have selected only one month. A single plot will be generated for that month.<br><br>\n\n<u>monthly_mean</u>: Use this if you selected multiple months and want a single plot showing the average values across all selected months.<br><br>\n\n<u>one_plot_per_month</u>: Use this if you selected multiple months and want a separate plot for each month.<br>", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 57, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "There are three options for how the data will be visualized:<br><br>\n\n<u>single_month</u>: Use this if you have selected only one month. A single plot will be generated for that month.<br><br>\n\n<u>monthly_mean</u>: Use this if you selected multiple months and want a single plot showing the average values across all selected months.<br><br>\n\n<u>one_plot_per_month</u>: Use this if you selected multiple months and want a separate plot for each month.<br>", "name": "Plot display mode"}], "label": "Plot display mode", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 8913.215047771753, "top": 583.9707331623031}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"default\": \"single_month\", \"multiple\": false, \"validators\": [], \"restrictions\": [\"single_month\", \"monthly_mean\", \"one_plot_per_month\"], \"parameter_type\": \"text\", \"optional\": false}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "01c720f2-d1df-4c68-80c4-58a2f4eef473", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "1d9ffab0-08cc-4082-8177-486ee91b0212"}]}, "58": {"annotation": "Enhances image quality by increasing the number of pixels through multiplication.", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 58, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "Enhances image quality by increasing the number of pixels through multiplication.", "name": "Multiplier_Fig9"}], "label": "Multiplier_Fig9", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 8913.215047771753, "top": 693.9707331623031}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"default\": 1, \"validators\": [{\"min\": null, \"max\": null, \"negate\": false, \"type\": \"in_range\"}], \"parameter_type\": \"integer\", \"optional\": false}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "dfe85636-66d2-45f3-bd74-9cbe854a6e04", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "bcab3f51-f873-4947-a425-552f2dba0d97"}]}, "59": {"annotation": "The default maximum index is set to 5 in the base report. You can choose to lower this value.<br>\nReducing the maximum allows for easier visualization of minor variations in areas with low chlorophyll presence.<br>", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 59, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "The default maximum index is set to 5 in the base report. You can choose to lower this value.<br>\nReducing the maximum allows for easier visualization of minor variations in areas with low chlorophyll presence.<br>", "name": "Maximum index selection"}], "label": "Maximum index selection", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 8913.215047771753, "top": 803.9707331623031}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"default\": 5.0, \"validators\": [{\"min\": null, \"max\": null, \"negate\": false, \"type\": \"in_range\"}], \"parameter_type\": \"float\", \"optional\": false}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "3ef54c0e-70a6-4253-ad99-f1375aa6e671", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "3db8955a-4e75-44bf-bbd0-4fd392cf2326"}]}, "60": {"annotation": "Do you want to display the legend?\n<center>\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TuturBaba/Antarctic/refs/heads/main/figure/Fig9_legend.png\" width=\"800\">\n</center>\nIf not, select <u>No legend</u>.<br>\nOtherwise, you can choose its orientation: <u>Horizontal</u> or <u>Vertical</u>.<br>", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 60, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "Do you want to display the legend?\n<center>\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TuturBaba/Antarctic/refs/heads/main/figure/Fig9_legend.png\" width=\"800\">\n</center>\nIf not, select <u>No legend</u>.<br>\nOtherwise, you can choose its orientation: <u>Horizontal</u> or <u>Vertical</u>.<br>", "name": "Legend display"}], "label": "Legend display", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 8913.215047771753, "top": 913.9707331623028}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"default\": \"No legend\", \"multiple\": false, \"validators\": [], \"restrictions\": [\"No legend\", \"Horizontal\", \"Vertical\"], \"parameter_type\": \"text\", \"optional\": false}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "2d35e4c6-e879-40f1-ae88-d4a344eba11e", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "e95b2ed1-e9f9-4496-9a54-c52063ff8b6c"}]}, "61": {"annotation": "Select how many monthly plots should be displayed per row.<br>\n\nThis setting is only used if you chose to display one plot per month.<br>", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 61, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "Select how many monthly plots should be displayed per row.<br>\n\nThis setting is only used if you chose to display one plot per month.<br>", "name": "Number of Plots per Row"}], "label": "Number of Plots per Row", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 8913.215047771753, "top": 1023.9707331623028}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"default\": 2, \"validators\": [{\"min\": 1, \"max\": null, \"negate\": false, \"type\": \"in_range\"}], \"parameter_type\": \"integer\", \"optional\": true}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "d4175f85-ab7b-431e-9225-8b39e887578a", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "43d57d3b-11dd-4acd-a6cf-f18213e92ef7"}]}, "62": {"annotation": "", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 62, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "", "name": "Title Fig9"}], "label": "Title Fig9", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 8913.215047771753, "top": 1133.9707331623035}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"default\": true, \"validators\": [], \"parameter_type\": \"boolean\", \"optional\": false}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "a5322bae-b0df-4e85-bbd1-f54c63d3f0b9", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "695452d4-7d31-4ce6-8195-aa5f94a56e32"}]}, "63": {"annotation": "", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 63, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "", "name": "ASD Fig9"}], "label": "ASD Fig9", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 8913.215047771753, "top": 1223.9707331623035}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"default\": true, \"validators\": [], \"parameter_type\": \"boolean\", \"optional\": false}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "6f7b45b2-684d-4089-982c-17e35f5eaa1f", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "d95a3b17-93a7-417c-a0f9-27d55a6a8823"}]}, "64": {"annotation": "Choose whether to fill the entire zone or display only the content within the selected ASD region.<br>\n- <b>Yes</b>: A cubic area will be displayed based on the selected ASD option, filling the entire zone.<br>\n- <b>No</b>: Only the actual content inside the selected ASD region will be shown.<br>\n\n<center>\n  <table>\n\t<tbody><tr>\n  \t<td>\n    \t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TuturBaba/Antarctic/refs/heads/main/figure/Fig9_48.png\" width=\"200\"><br>\n    \tNo\n  \t</td>\n  \t<td>\n    \t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TuturBaba/Antarctic/refs/heads/main/figure/Fig9_fill.png\" width=\"200\"><br>\n    \tYes\n  \t</td>\n\t</tr>\n  </tbody></table>\n</center>\n", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 64, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "Choose whether to fill the entire zone or display only the content within the selected ASD region.<br>\n- <b>Yes</b>: A cubic area will be displayed based on the selected ASD option, filling the entire zone.<br>\n- <b>No</b>: Only the actual content inside the selected ASD region will be shown.<br>\n\n<center>\n  <table>\n\t<tbody><tr>\n  \t<td>\n    \t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TuturBaba/Antarctic/refs/heads/main/figure/Fig9_48.png\" width=\"200\"><br>\n    \tNo\n  \t</td>\n  \t<td>\n    \t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TuturBaba/Antarctic/refs/heads/main/figure/Fig9_fill.png\" width=\"200\"><br>\n    \tYes\n  \t</td>\n\t</tr>\n  </tbody></table>\n</center>\n", "name": "Fill Entire Zone Fig9"}], "label": "Fill Entire Zone Fig9", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 8913.215047771753, "top": 1313.9707331623035}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"default\": true, \"validators\": [], \"parameter_type\": \"boolean\", \"optional\": false}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "e09802a3-217a-4717-9b56-afaef3e1579a", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "35124434-2c70-4823-83c8-548aa9002cc9"}]}, "65": {"annotation": "", "content_id": "toolshed.g2.bx.psu.edu/repos/bgruening/text_processing/tp_text_file_with_recurring_lines/9.5+galaxy1", "errors": null, "id": 65, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [], "label": null, "name": "Create text file", "outputs": [{"name": "outfile", "type": "txt"}], "position": {"left": 9751.164137978827, "top": 159.5694317276607}, "post_job_actions": {}, "tool_id": "toolshed.g2.bx.psu.edu/repos/bgruening/text_processing/tp_text_file_with_recurring_lines/9.5+galaxy1", "tool_shed_repository": {"changeset_revision": "6073bb457ec0", "name": "text_processing", "owner": "bgruening", "tool_shed": "toolshed.g2.bx.psu.edu"}, "tool_state": "{\"token_set\": [{\"__index__\": 0, \"line\": \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TuturBaba/Antarctic/refs/heads/main/script/indicator_plot.ipynb\", \"repeat_select\": {\"repeat_select_opts\": \"user\", \"__current_case__\": 0, \"times\": \"1\"}}], \"__page__\": 0, \"__rerun_remap_job_id__\": null}", "tool_version": "9.5+galaxy1", "type": "tool", "uuid": "6904d0af-ae9b-427d-a9a5-f29fd885a6ad", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": []}, "66": {"annotation": "This figure shows the evolution of selected species over time, based on their population data.<br>\nUseful to monitor abundance trends and compare species dynamics.<br><br>\n<center>\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TuturBaba/Antarctic/refs/heads/main/figure/indicator_plot.png\" width=\"500\">\n</center>", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 66, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "This figure shows the evolution of selected species over time, based on their population data.<br>\nUseful to monitor abundance trends and compare species dynamics.<br><br>\n<center>\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TuturBaba/Antarctic/refs/heads/main/figure/indicator_plot.png\" width=\"500\">\n</center>", "name": "FIG: SPECIES TIME SERIES PLOT"}], "label": "FIG: SPECIES TIME SERIES PLOT", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 10222.454655598822, "top": 57.30236409024721}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"validators\": [], \"parameter_type\": \"boolean\", \"optional\": false}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "2836a3b1-ce84-4a2c-828c-d3289eb73473", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "e335adb5-ea09-4bb5-8186-b93789cd2354"}]}, "67": {"annotation": "Upload a CSV file where the first column contains dates and the remaining columns contain numerical values.", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 67, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "Upload a CSV file where the first column contains dates and the remaining columns contain numerical values.", "name": "CSV File Upload indicator"}], "label": "CSV File Upload indicator", "name": "Input dataset", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 10223.392441719558, "top": 301.16562997331937}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"optional\": true, \"tag\": null}", "tool_version": null, "type": "data_input", "uuid": "b15d6d3e-ee60-4f44-a335-b9607e1dab14", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": []}, "68": {"annotation": "There are two options for how the data can be visualized:<br><br>\n<u>merged_view</u>: Choose this option if you want all the data displayed in a single plot. <br><br>\n<u>split_view</u>: Choose this option if you prefer a separate plot for each column.<br><br>", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 68, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "There are two options for how the data can be visualized:<br><br>\n<u>merged_view</u>: Choose this option if you want all the data displayed in a single plot. <br><br>\n<u>split_view</u>: Choose this option if you prefer a separate plot for each column.<br><br>", "name": "Plot display mode indcator"}], "label": "Plot display mode indcator", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 10223.392441719558, "top": 411.16562997331937}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"default\": \"merged_view\", \"multiple\": false, \"validators\": [], \"restrictions\": [\"merged_view\", \"split_view\"], \"parameter_type\": \"text\", \"optional\": false}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "941ce610-aa5a-4f9f-b9fd-4d6954bbd32b", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "5ae89019-e06d-4efa-b7f2-39706b7d6261"}]}, "69": {"annotation": "Which columns would you like to use for visualization?\nEnter the column numbers, separated by commas.\nDo not include column 1 \u2014 it represents the year.", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 69, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "Which columns would you like to use for visualization?\nEnter the column numbers, separated by commas.\nDo not include column 1 \u2014 it represents the year.", "name": "Data Columns Selection"}], "label": "Data Columns Selection", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 10223.392441719558, "top": 521.1656299733194}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"multiple\": false, \"validators\": [], \"parameter_type\": \"text\", \"optional\": true}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "7b4b200b-a489-4cb4-80a7-e44bb3eac167", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "255c030a-dcd3-4918-95b2-c428eddebbf7"}]}, "70": {"annotation": "Enter a word to filter the columns you want to visualize.\nAll columns whose names contain this word will be selected automatically.\nThe \"Year\" column will be included by default.\ne.g. : \"Log\", \"n pairs\"", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 70, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "Enter a word to filter the columns you want to visualize.\nAll columns whose names contain this word will be selected automatically.\nThe \"Year\" column will be included by default.\ne.g. : \"Log\", \"n pairs\"", "name": "Select by Keyword"}], "label": "Select by Keyword", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 10223.392441719558, "top": 631.1656299733194}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"multiple\": false, \"validators\": [], \"parameter_type\": \"text\", \"optional\": true}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "b3037749-c3d7-4fe2-baa9-bde4b6a9d755", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "3fd218af-5904-42cb-be56-f407cf78ad28"}]}, "71": {"annotation": "", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 71, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "", "name": "Titile indicator"}], "label": "Titile indicator", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 10223.392441719558, "top": 741.1656299733194}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"multiple\": false, \"validators\": [], \"parameter_type\": \"text\", \"optional\": true}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "1784c360-67c8-446e-9c82-4597c6130a76", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "d29b0bc0-8beb-4253-9ecb-021e8a051604"}]}, "72": {"annotation": "", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 72, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "", "name": "Label x indicator"}], "label": "Label x indicator", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 10223.392441719558, "top": 831.1656299733194}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"multiple\": false, \"validators\": [], \"parameter_type\": \"text\", \"optional\": true}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "0f944e95-e7ac-48cb-aae1-a619820dee81", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "ac4b549c-cb33-49ae-acae-661ec87f506c"}]}, "73": {"annotation": "", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 73, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "", "name": "Label y indicator"}], "label": "Label y indicator", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 10223.392441719558, "top": 921.1656299733194}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"multiple\": false, \"validators\": [], \"parameter_type\": \"text\", \"optional\": true}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "1e795da0-6089-4c43-a8b0-0148d568d4ce", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "d5f474fd-8d78-4c36-8df7-4dd6a58e8a3d"}]}, "74": {"annotation": "<strong>If this option is selected, you will need to choose a reference year to act as a baseline (value = 1). </strong><br>\nAll other years will be scaled relative to this reference year, and a log transformation will be applied to the resulting values. <br>\nThis process ensures that all data is brought onto a comparable scale, making differences between years easier to interpret. <br>\n\nMake sure the input column contains year values for all selected data columns.", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 74, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "<strong>If this option is selected, you will need to choose a reference year to act as a baseline (value = 1). </strong><br>\nAll other years will be scaled relative to this reference year, and a log transformation will be applied to the resulting values. <br>\nThis process ensures that all data is brought onto a comparable scale, making differences between years easier to interpret. <br>\n\nMake sure the input column contains year values for all selected data columns.", "name": "Log Transformation Based on Reference Year"}], "label": "Log Transformation Based on Reference Year", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 10223.392441719558, "top": 1011.1656299733194}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"default\": false, \"validators\": [], \"parameter_type\": \"boolean\", \"optional\": false}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "6bfb89f5-0b66-4833-80bd-a4e623354e5c", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "60963b10-a94a-417e-8dce-214199b5e4c6"}]}, "75": {"annotation": "<strong> Optional: Define the reference date for log transformation.</strong> <br>\n\nYou can choose from the following options:<br><br>\n<li>    <strong> A specific date</strong>  (e.g., 2000, 2000-01, 2000-01-01): This date will be used as the baseline.<br></li>\n Make sure that all selected columns contain data for this exact date.<br><br>\n\n<li>    <strong> first: </strong> The first available value in each column will be used as the reference.</li><br>\n\n<li>   <strong>  last: </strong> The last available value in each column will be used as the reference.</li>", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 75, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "<strong> Optional: Define the reference date for log transformation.</strong> <br>\n\nYou can choose from the following options:<br><br>\n<li>    <strong> A specific date</strong>  (e.g., 2000, 2000-01, 2000-01-01): This date will be used as the baseline.<br></li>\n Make sure that all selected columns contain data for this exact date.<br><br>\n\n<li>    <strong> first: </strong> The first available value in each column will be used as the reference.</li><br>\n\n<li>   <strong>  last: </strong> The last available value in each column will be used as the reference.</li>", "name": "Reference Date (for Log Transformation)"}], "label": "Reference Date (for Log Transformation)", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 10223.392441719558, "top": 1141.1656299733197}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"multiple\": false, \"validators\": [], \"suggestions\": [\"2000\", \"first\", \"last\"], \"parameter_type\": \"text\", \"optional\": true}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "aac26ebc-b347-47f1-9707-9b476bcd7048", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "3948341a-22b9-4b10-8279-5956743864ef"}]}, "76": {"annotation": "", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 76, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "", "name": "Width PNG indicator"}], "label": "Width PNG indicator", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 10223.392441719558, "top": 1251.1656299733197}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"default\": 6, \"validators\": [{\"min\": null, \"max\": null, \"negate\": false, \"type\": \"in_range\"}], \"parameter_type\": \"integer\", \"optional\": false}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "f6fffa23-e13f-4d5a-bbc1-6a21a4f9cd73", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "dc22265c-156d-45a5-999f-cf1b2ac82efd"}]}, "77": {"annotation": "", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 77, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "", "name": "Resolution PNG indicator"}], "label": "Resolution PNG indicator", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 10224.737359362767, "top": 1361.1873612369093}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"default\": 300, \"validators\": [{\"min\": null, \"max\": null, \"negate\": false, \"type\": \"in_range\"}], \"parameter_type\": \"integer\", \"optional\": false}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "18f076ac-92c2-4e3e-b862-4eca8d316fed", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "396f1955-c258-4a57-bde6-0b6136dd87e5"}]}, "78": {"annotation": "", "content_id": "toolshed.g2.bx.psu.edu/repos/bgruening/text_processing/tp_text_file_with_recurring_lines/9.5+galaxy1", "errors": null, "id": 78, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [], "label": null, "name": "Create text file", "outputs": [{"name": "outfile", "type": "txt"}], "position": {"left": 10859.048656927494, "top": 150.49953068747993}, "post_job_actions": {}, "tool_id": "toolshed.g2.bx.psu.edu/repos/bgruening/text_processing/tp_text_file_with_recurring_lines/9.5+galaxy1", "tool_shed_repository": {"changeset_revision": "6073bb457ec0", "name": "text_processing", "owner": "bgruening", "tool_shed": "toolshed.g2.bx.psu.edu"}, "tool_state": "{\"token_set\": [{\"__index__\": 0, \"line\": \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TuturBaba/Antarctic/refs/heads/main/script/plot_cover.ipynb\", \"repeat_select\": {\"repeat_select_opts\": \"user\", \"__current_case__\": 0, \"times\": \"1\"}}], \"__page__\": 0, \"__rerun_remap_job_id__\": null}", "tool_version": "9.5+galaxy1", "type": "tool", "uuid": "8764cf7b-3760-4599-95a6-0bab05a62089", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": []}, "79": {"annotation": "This figure shows how a selected metric (Y-axis) changes over time (X-axis), for different groups (e.g., sites).<br><br>\n\nYou can also display an optional numeric variable as <b>point size</b>, such as species richness.<br>\nEach group will be shown as a colored line with data points.<br><br>\n\nUseful for exploring <b>temporal trends</b>, <b>group comparisons</b>, and <b>richness-weighted patterns</b>.<br><br>\n<center>\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TuturBaba/Antarctic/refs/heads/main/figure/plot_cover.png\" width=\"500\">\n</center>\n", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 79, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "This figure shows how a selected metric (Y-axis) changes over time (X-axis), for different groups (e.g., sites).<br><br>\n\nYou can also display an optional numeric variable as <b>point size</b>, such as species richness.<br>\nEach group will be shown as a colored line with data points.<br><br>\n\nUseful for exploring <b>temporal trends</b>, <b>group comparisons</b>, and <b>richness-weighted patterns</b>.<br><br>\n<center>\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TuturBaba/Antarctic/refs/heads/main/figure/plot_cover.png\" width=\"500\">\n</center>\n", "name": "FIG: COLONIZATION DYNAMICS PLOT"}], "label": "FIG: COLONIZATION DYNAMICS PLOT", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 11339.64217762157, "top": 37.755733233554}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"validators\": [], \"parameter_type\": \"boolean\", \"optional\": false}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "1219e6ca-ee72-45be-bcaf-a8c4ecb5b8e6", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "2c01d598-261b-428e-b09e-2f59b2839f42"}]}, "80": {"annotation": "Upload a CSV file where the <strong> first column contains dates </strong> ", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 80, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "Upload a CSV file where the <strong> first column contains dates </strong> ", "name": "CSV File Upload "}], "label": "CSV File Upload ", "name": "Input dataset", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 11342.018200691113, "top": 306.48510667373}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"optional\": true, \"tag\": null}", "tool_version": null, "type": "data_input", "uuid": "31715c67-ed95-455f-93e2-b6e7f1ebf1a7", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": []}, "81": {"annotation": "Enter the exact  name of the column to use for the Y-axis.<br>\nThis column should be numeric, and you must type the exact column name as it appears in your CSV.<br>", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 81, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "Enter the exact  name of the column to use for the Y-axis.<br>\nThis column should be numeric, and you must type the exact column name as it appears in your CSV.<br>", "name": "Y-axis Column"}], "label": "Y-axis Column", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 11342.018200691113, "top": 416.48510667373}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"default\": \"Coverage\", \"multiple\": false, \"validators\": [], \"parameter_type\": \"text\", \"optional\": false}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "ba94d0f2-a0f4-4fcb-a0dd-729a20139a0a", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "9a3b989f-da53-4fee-ae22-1339f531f12e"}]}, "82": {"annotation": "It's optional <br>\nDefine the Y-axis limits manually by providing two numbers separated by a semicolon (;). <br>\nExample: 0;100 will set the Y-axis range from 0 to 100.", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 82, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "It's optional <br>\nDefine the Y-axis limits manually by providing two numbers separated by a semicolon (;). <br>\nExample: 0;100 will set the Y-axis range from 0 to 100.", "name": "Y-axis Limits "}], "label": "Y-axis Limits ", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 11342.018200691113, "top": 526.48510667373}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"multiple\": false, \"validators\": [], \"parameter_type\": \"text\", \"optional\": true}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "58bc9f47-8e3b-44b4-a2ab-00a84d177c97", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "a70e7b06-4ae5-442b-a8fb-1b9255539e45"}]}, "83": {"annotation": "Enter the name of the column used to group lines by color.<br>\nEach unique value in this column will define a separate line.<br>", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 83, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "Enter the name of the column used to group lines by color.<br>\nEach unique value in this column will define a separate line.<br>", "name": "Line Grouping Column Name"}], "label": "Line Grouping Column Name", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 11342.018200691113, "top": 636.48510667373}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"default\": \"site\", \"multiple\": false, \"validators\": [], \"parameter_type\": \"text\", \"optional\": false}", "tool_version": null, "type": "parameter_input", "uuid": "59c3f144-99f4-4a85-83eb-f0ad1a6092e6", "when": null, "workflow_outputs": [{"label": null, "output_name": "output", "uuid": "21dda31e-9fb7-4a9e-bf0b-dfaa35c56901"}]}, "84": {"annotation": "Enter the name of the column used to control point size.<br>\nThis numeric column will be aggregated and mapped to the size of the points in the plot.<br>", "content_id": null, "errors": null, "id": 84, "input_connections": {}, "inputs": [{"description": "Enter the name of the column used to control point size.<br>\nThis numeric column will be aggregated and mapped to the size of the points in the plot.<br>", "name": " Point Size Column Name"}], "label": " Point Size Column Name", "name": "Input parameter", "outputs": [], "position": {"left": 11342.018200691113, "top": 746.48510667373}, "tool_id": null, "tool_state": "{\"multiple\": false, \"validators\": [], \"parameter_type\": \"t